        <!-- ===================== §6 · THE FIVE STATES ===================== -->
        <section class="sec" id="states">
          <h2>Iowa, Kentucky, Maryland, Tennessee, Wisconsin — What Buyers There Ask</h2>
          <p class="opener">These five states send us more questions than most, and the questions are practical rather than philosophical: which airport, what the drive looks like at the other end, and whether the paperwork changes at a state line. It does not.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "african-grey-shipping-routes-five-states-infographic.webp"}
               srcset={IMG + "african-grey-shipping-routes-five-states-infographic-760.webp 760w, " + IMG + "african-grey-shipping-routes-five-states-infographic.webp 1408w"}
