          <h3>What Buyers in These Five States Ask Us Most</h3>
          <p>Three questions, in this order: how the bird travels, what arrives with it, and what happens if something is wrong on the first day. The answers are the same whether you are in Des Moines or Baltimore, which is rather the point of writing them on one page instead of five.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "what-buyers-in-five-states-ask-most-infographic.webp"}
               srcset={IMG + "what-buyers-in-five-states-ask-most-infographic-760.webp 760w, " + IMG + "what-buyers-in-five-states-ask-most-infographic.webp 1408w"}
               sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 760px" width="1408" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
