          <h3>Your Nearest Cargo Airport, and What It Changes</h3>
          <p>It changes the day rather than the price. A direct route means an afternoon collection; a city served only by connections means we look at home delivery instead. Tell us your city and we will tell you which of the three routes actually works from here.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "your-nearest-cargo-airport-changes-the-day-infographic.webp"}
