        <!-- ===================== §7 · CONGO OR TIMNEH ===================== -->
        <section class="sec" id="choose">
          <h2>Congo or Timneh — Which Suits Your Household?</h2>
          <p class="opener"><StatementLabel kind="fact" source="https://www.iucnredlist.org/species/22724813/154068029" />Both are African Greys, and the two subspecies of <em>Psittacus erithacus</em> differ in size, tail colour and beak more than most buyers expect. Which one suits you is a question about your rooms and your routine rather than about which bird is better.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "congo-or-timneh-identity-cards-infographic.webp"}
               srcset={IMG + "congo-or-timneh-identity-cards-infographic-760.webp 760w, " + IMG + "congo-or-timneh-identity-cards-infographic.webp 1408w"}
               sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 760px" width="1408" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
               alt="Congo and Timneh African Grey identity cards compared side by side">

          <h3>If This Is Your First Parrot</h3>
          <p><StatementLabel kind="fact" source="https://www.iucnredlist.org/species/22724813/154068029" />An African Grey lives 40 to 60 years in good care, so a bird bought this year may still be with your household in the 2080s. That is the fact worth sitting with before the price is. We point most first-time owners at a Timneh, because ours tend to settle faster and take household noise in their stride. That is a tendency rather than a rule, and Bery would suit a beginner better than some Timnehs would. <a href="/congo-vs-timneh-african-grey/">The full comparison</a> sets both birds out trait by trait if you want to decide it yourself.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "if-this-is-your-first-african-grey-parrot-infographic.webp"}
               srcset={IMG + "if-this-is-your-first-african-grey-parrot-infographic-760.webp 760w, " + IMG + "if-this-is-your-first-african-grey-parrot-infographic.webp 1408w"}
               sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 760px" width="1408" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
               alt="Where a first-time parrot owner lands between the two Greys">

