            <p class="xsell-k">If you already know which one you want</p>
            <p>Go straight to the subspecies pages, where each bird is set out on its own with its own photographs and price: <a href="/congo-african-grey-for-sale/">Congo African Greys for sale</a> or <a href="/timneh-african-grey-for-sale/">Timneh African Greys for sale</a>. <a href="/african-grey-parrots-for-sale-near-me/">Buyers looking for a breeder near them</a> can start from the state grid instead.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

